# The first project tagged @inbox, nested or not, is listed apart under its own name; an untagged INBOX and a second tagged project stay under Projects.
file <<END
Work:
	Capture: @inbox
		- nested
		- more
INBOX:
	- untagged
Later: @inbox
	- second
END
keys <C-g>
see │▌ 󰚇 Capture                                 2 │
see   INBOX                                     1 │
see   Later                                     1 │
keys <Enter>
see - more
hide - second
quit
